{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/38920-demon-errata","id":38920,"title":"Demon Errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-29T15:30:08-08:00","id":38920,"title":"Demon Errata","content":"Please report typos and layout issues with the <b>Demon: The Descent</b> PDF here.<br /> <br /> This thread will close <b>12:00 PM EST, Thursday January 16th</b>, so that we can begin final corrections.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 01-15-2014, 04:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T17:43:42-08:00","id":38986,"title":"","content":"Beautiful book. I'm sure you've gushed to the artists you hired on this book, but please gush more for them and for Michael Chaney for me.<br /> I will be jumping back and forth in the PDF, and possibly miss other posts made while I was browsing.<br /> <br /> p. 64: &quot;facilites&quot; instead of &quot;facilities.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T18:17:58-08:00","id":39001,"title":"","content":"PDF bookmark issues:<br /> The Angels Are Connected bookmark contains, rather than precedes, the rest of the bookmarks in its section.<br /> To Serve in Heaven contains, rather than precedes, To Reign in Hell.<br /> Character Creation contains a separate bookmark for each step of the process, not collapsed into one category separate from the other bookmarks in this section.<br /> There is no bookmark at all for the Character Creation Quick Reference, which one would refer to a lot, considering it contains the experience cost table.<br /> The individual splat splashes are also not collapsed into sections.<br /> The Human Body contains, rather than precedes, every other bookmark in its chapter.<br /> Mapping the Territory contains, rather than precedes, Geography: X Axis, which in turn does the same to Geography: Y Axis.<br /> Character Creation and Advancement contains the entire chapter's bookmarks instead of just the relevant ones.<br /> Attributes, Skills and Merits includes, rather than precedes, Aspirations.<br /> Virtue and Vice in Play includes, rather than precedes, Experience.<br /> There is no bookmark for the Combat Summary Chart, the Ranged Weapons Chart, the Melee Weapons Chart or the Armor Chart.<br /> <br /> More typos or errors:<br /> p. 115: &quot;five Cover Beats becomes&quot; instead of &quot;five Cover Beats become.&quot;<br /> p. 122: the title of the Terrible Form Merit appears to have a comma separating its dot levels and &quot;Style,&quot; but the font does not display the comma.<br /> p. 193 implies that three Cover experiences equates to one dot of Cover, while p. 89 asserts that a Cover dot only costs two experiences.<br /> p. 283: this chapter spread fiction is in a different font from the other spread fictions.<br /> p. 305: Light Weapons, Marksmanship and Martial Arts: same problem as Terrible Form<br /> p. 306: Ditto Police Tactics, Street Fighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-29T18:46:48-08:00","id":39014,"title":"","content":"...it's out? I haven't even got my survey yet...<br /> <br /> Edit: Never mind, I see what happened!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":19